#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:12
msgid "Supported Components"
msgstr "支持的组件"

#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:14
msgid "StickS3 supports the following components:"
msgstr "StickS3 支持以下组件："

#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:16
msgid ""
"`Unit <../unit/index.html>`_: The ``unit`` package containing Unit "
"drivers."
msgstr ""
"`Unit <../unit/index.html>`_：包含 Unit 驱动的 ``unit`` 软件包。"

#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:17
msgid "`Chain <../chain/index.html>`_: The ``chain`` package for Chain devices."
msgstr "`Chain <../chain/index.html>`_：用于 Chain 设备的 ``chain`` 软件包。"

#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:18
msgid "`HAT <../hat/index.html>`_: The ``hat`` package for HAT devices."
msgstr "`HAT <../hat/index.html>`_：用于 HAT 设备的 ``hat`` 软件包。"

#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:19
msgid ""
"`USB <../advanced/usb/device/index.html>`_: The ``usb.device`` package "
"for HID devices."
msgstr ""
"`USB <../advanced/usb/device/index.html>`_：用于 HID 设备的 ``usb.device`` 软件包。"

#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:22
msgid "Supported Display Fonts"
msgstr "支持的显示字体"

#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:24
msgid "The StickS3 firmware includes the following Montserrat fonts for LVGL and M5UI: ``lv.font_montserrat_12``, ``lv.font_montserrat_14``, ``lv.font_montserrat_16``, ``lv.font_montserrat_18``, ``lv.font_montserrat_24``, ``lv.font_montserrat_40``, ``lv.font_montserrat_44``, and ``lv.font_montserrat_48``."
msgstr "StickS3 固件为 LVGL 和 M5UI 提供以下 Montserrat 字体：``lv.font_montserrat_12``、``lv.font_montserrat_14``、``lv.font_montserrat_16``、``lv.font_montserrat_18``、``lv.font_montserrat_24``、``lv.font_montserrat_40``、``lv.font_montserrat_44`` 和 ``lv.font_montserrat_48``。"

#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:31
msgid "For ``M5.Lcd.FONTS``, the firmware also provides ``AlibabaPuHuiTiCN24``, ``AlibabaSansJA24``, and ``AlibabaSansKR24`` for Chinese, Japanese, and Korean text respectively."
msgstr "对于 ``M5.Lcd.FONTS``，固件还提供 ``AlibabaPuHuiTiCN24``、``AlibabaSansJA24`` 和 ``AlibabaSansKR24``，分别用于显示中文、日文和韩文。"

#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:36
msgid "Board Features"
msgstr "板载功能"

#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:26
msgid ""
"StickS3 supports the following built-in functions and connected "
"peripherals:"
msgstr "StickS3 支持以下内置功能和连接的外设："

#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:28
msgid "Button input and display output."
msgstr "按键输入和显示输出。"

#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:29
msgid "`IMU <../hardware/imu.html>`_ accelerometer and gyroscope readings."
msgstr "`IMU <../hardware/imu.html>`_ 加速度计和陀螺仪读数。"

#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:30
msgid "Battery, VBUS, charging, and external output power management."
msgstr "电池、VBUS、充电和外部输出电源管理。"

#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:31
msgid "`Infrared <../hardware/ir.html>`_ transmit and receive."
msgstr "`红外 <../hardware/ir.html>`_ 发送与接收。"

#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:32
msgid "`Audio <../system/audio.html>`_ recording and playback."
msgstr "`音频 <../system/audio.html>`_ 录制与播放。"

#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:33
msgid "`ToF HAT <../hat/tof.html>`_ distance measurement."
msgstr "`ToF HAT <../hat/tof.html>`_ 距离测量。"

