msgstr "在 UiFlow2 中打开 |sticks3_imu_example.m5f2| 项目。"

#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:58
#: ../../source/controllers/sticks3.rst:170
msgid ""
"This example demonstrates the built-in IMU (Inertial Measurement Unit) "
"sensor functionality. It reads and displays accelerometer and gyroscope "
"data in real-time, showing acceleration values in m/s² and gyroscope "
"values in degrees per second (dps)."
msgstr ""
"此示例演示了内置 IMU（惯性测量单元）传感器功能。它实时读取并显示加速度计和陀螺仪数据，以 m/s² 显示加速度值，以度/秒 (dps) "
"显示陀螺仪值。"

